How to install
--------------

This is real simple. All ya got to do is:

1. unarchive this file (already done)

2. copy the directory, Estatz, to your pfiles: assign.

3. Edit your BBSMENU file with Ced, ED, Edit, or your favorite editor, and type
Edit ST under menu 2; available everywhere to read 2ST or you can just 
add it to your pfile or gfile menus.

4. at the end of all the listings in Menu 2 add: 
ST | {#0PFiles:Estatz/EuphoriaStatz.rexx}

5. and that's it!

